  "title": "Pinwheel Cookies",
  "description": "These pinwheel cookies, filled with a swirl of sweet and gooey dates and chopped nuts, are a delicious spiral cookie treat perfect for the holidays.",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie Salopek"
  ],
